# AI (Kimi / Moonshot) works out of the box: the API key is hardcoded in
# src/lib/ai-narrative.ts (EMBEDDED_KEY), so no environment file is needed.
# These optional overrides exist for special situations only. To use one, copy
# this file to .env.local (git-ignored) and uncomment the line.

# MOONSHOT_BASE_URL=https://api.moonshot.ai/v1   # or https://api.moonshot.cn/v1 for the China platform
# MOONSHOT_MODEL=kimi-latest                     # default; auto-falls back to moonshot-v1-128k / -32k
# MOONSHOT_TIMEOUT_MS=90000
# MOONSHOT_MAX_TOKENS=8000
# MOONSHOT_ENABLED=0                             # turn AI off (deterministic PDF narrative, assistant disabled)
